#: scenario3:scenario3_FC98BB8F_7881_42C9_96FA_30DB641620D0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e9fa55077f9487adf8411be381352d558db3a1d780069cf008d7b5de98c50671
